abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos): a browser-only teaching demo of Baohuang ("protect the emperor"), a five-player four-deck shedding game: the emperor and a guard against three civilians, with the self-guard variant. The JavaScript engine reproduces the Python engine move-by-move; AIs are rule-based and a side panel explains each greedy decision.
